---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Security & Data Protection"
  description="Security architecture, DDD multi-tenant isolation, encryption and compliance for institutional academic records."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrlFr="/fr/securite/"
  alternateUrlEn="/en/security/"
>
  <section class="py-16 bg-slate-900 text-white border-b border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">Security & Data Sovereignty</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Every institution gets a strictly isolated environment with cryptographic guarantees and automated backups.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50 text-slate-900">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🔒 Strict Multi-Tenant Isolation (DDD Architecture)</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Pineapple OS enforces isolation at the domain layer level (Domain-Driven Design). Every backend request is validated against cryptographic JWT tokens containing `tenant_id` (`tid`) and `membership_id` (`mid`). It is technically impossible for a user from one institution to access another institution's data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🛡️ Privacy Protection & Compliance</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Student registers and administrative data are never sold or shared with third parties. All communications are encrypted via TLS 1.3 in transit and AES-256 at rest. Students retain their right to access and rectify their records via their school registrar.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">💾 Automated Backups & Disaster Recovery</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          PostgreSQL databases undergo encrypted daily backups with automated restoration testing (Point-In-Time Recovery RPO &lt; 1h, RTO &lt; 4h). Even during major network outages or server failure, your data remains safe and recoverable.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
